mapping "W0648.1" source="W0648" target="20902002" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W0648 SNOMED CT 20902002 = Fall from bed on street/highway during other specified activity.
        Swedish extension adds two circumstantial axes (place=street/highway, activity=other specified)
        to the base ICD-10 W06. Target SNOMED CT 436882 (concept_code 20902002, standard_concept=S) = Fall
        from bed; verified Maps-to crosswalk from W06 in both ICD10 (45575895→436882) and ICD10CM
        (20987→436882). The place-specific SNOMED CT concepts (40419706 [X]Fall involving bed on
        street/highway; 44801421 UK extension) are non-standard (invalid_reason=U, no S flag) and cannot
        serve as targets. 436882 is the closest standard ancestor; it fully captures the clinical fall
        event but drops the place/activity context. Broader: target subsumes the event axis;
        place/activity are circumstantial attributes, not separate clinical components. High tier :
        one-level breadth mismatch with a verified crosswalk.
        """
}
